        <span className="font-mono text-slate-400">{label.trim() || "sub"}.{primaryDomain}</span> →{" "}
        <span className="font-mono text-brand-300">{pointToA}</span> (or a wildcard{" "}
        <span className="font-mono text-slate-400">*.{primaryDomain}</span>). HTTPS for subdomains is a follow-up — they serve over HTTP until then.
